The '''Polis Massa system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Subterrel sector]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]]. It was home to the [[planet]] [[Polis Massa]] until the world<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> was [[Polis Massa cataclysm|destroyed]] by ancient [[superweapon]]s,<ref name="Jedi Fallen Order">''[[Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order]]''</ref> leaving behind only an [[asteroid field]]. [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] gave birth to [[Luke Skywalker]] and [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Princess Leia Organa]] in the asteroid field.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />

